  "bosc:provenance": {
    "subject": "City of Mansfield rezone Ordinance 25-086 (Bill 25-087; City Planning Commission Petition #561), passed as an emergency 2025-06-03: 16 lots at and around Airport West Parkway & Cairns Road rezoned from I-1 (Limited Impact Industrial District) to I-2 (General Impact Industrial District), amending the City Zoning Districts Map (Ord. #04-208). Mansfield, Richland County OH (FIPS 39139). This is the site's first committed footprint geometry (places domain, #1431).",
