    "caveats": [
      "[verified] Owner-of-record, situs, acreage, class, appraised value and sale date/price are verbatim from the Richland County Auditor CAMA (Parcel_CAMA layer 0); null means the service had no value. `acres` is the recorded LEGAL_ACRES; `calculated_acres` (planar) is carried only when it differs.",
      "The ordinance lists 16 lots 'as recorded in the Richland County Auditor's Office'. The CURRENT auditor parcel fabric resolves 10 of the 16; the other 6 (028-90-500-93-002/003/004/006/007 and 028-90-150-51-001) no longer exist as separate parcels \u2014 they were consolidated/renumbered into current parcels (notably 028-90-500-93-000, City of Mansfield, 129.53 ac) since the 2025-06-03 rezone. Retired IDs are preserved here (retired_parcel_ids); their geometry is NOT fabricated.",
      "The 10 committed lots sum to ~309.1 recorded legal acres, reconciling with the ~321 ac reported for the 16-lot schedule; the ~12 ac residual is the retired lots' area absorbed into current parcels plus legal-vs-planar acreage differences.",
      "The auditor ZONING and USEDSCRP columns are UNPOPULATED in this layer \u2014 the I-1->I-2 status is from Ordinance 25-086, not the auditor zoning field. `zoning_change`/`ordinance` on each feature record the instrument, not an auditor attribute.",
      "Adena Development Corp (the city-affiliated CIC named in press coverage) is not a current owner-of-record on the 10 resolved lots \u2014 the City of Mansfield owns 7, and 37 East Fourth Street LTD (an Ohio LLC) owns 3 (028-90-150-49/50/51). Adena's holdings, if any, are among the retired/renumbered lots or were conveyed to the City. [reference] for the Adena attribution.",
      "Multipart parcels (028-90-500-48-000 = 4 parts; 028-90-500-93-000 = 2 parts) are returned by the service as repeated single-ring features and are assembled here into one MultiPolygon per parcel; sum committed_count (10), not raw service features (14).",
      "Right-state guard: Richland County OHIO (FIPS 39139), owner city Mansfield OH 449xx, WKID 3734 (NAD83 Ohio North ftUS) reprojected to 4326. Not the same-named Richland County WI/SC/IL.",
      "Regenerable: query Parcel_CAMA/MapServer/0 with where=PARCELID IN (schedule ids), outSR=4326, f=json (this ArcGIS 10.3 server does not support f=geojson), then convert esri rings -> GeoJSON (see data/reference/mansfield/README.md)."
    ]
  },
